sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Patient
    participant UI as web/controller
    participant CH as ChatService
    participant RT as Router
    participant PL as AnalysisPipeline
    participant PR as PatientResponder
    participant CF as CaseFiler
    participant CO as Communicator
    participant AI as OpenAI
    participant BG as InsightService
    P->>UI: "I have fever and cough since 3 days"
    UI->>CH: ask(question, session)
    CH->>RT: route()
    RT-->>CH: plan: mode=case, symptoms=[fever, cough]
    CH->>PL: run(ctx): extraction, analysis, risk
    PL-->>UI: quick check + risk guidance (instant)
    CH->>PR: respond(ctx)
    PR->>CF: needs_case? (new symptoms: yes)
    PR->>CO: communicate(rule-based findings)
    CO->>AI: one streamed call (fast model)
    AI-->>UI: words appear as they stream
    CO->>CF: file case (open or update the ONE case)
    CF-->>UI: "Case C-… created, with care coordinator"
    PR->>BG: write Insight in the background
    BG->>AI: one call (strong model), saved on the case
